---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Disclaimer" description="Legal disclaimer for Leaving The Matrix.">
  <section class="container-prose py-24">
    <p class="eyebrow">Legal</p>
    <h1 class="mt-4 font-display text-display-md uppercase tracking-tight">Disclaimer</h1>

    <div class="prose-ltm mt-12">
      <p class="text-bone-dim">
        <em>Last updated: <time datetime="2026-05-03">May 3, 2026</em></time>. This document is a draft pending legal review.
      </p>

      <h2>Educational content only</h2>
      <p>
        All content on Leaving The Matrix — including but not limited to articles, signals, trade ideas, education
        materials, Discord discussions, and any other communications — is provided for <strong>educational and
        informational purposes only</strong>. Nothing on this site or in the Discord constitutes investment advice,
        financial advice, trading advice, or any other sort of advice, and you should not treat any content as such.
      </p>

      <h2>No fiduciary relationship</h2>
      <p>
        Leaving The Matrix and its operators are not registered investment advisers, broker-dealers, or financial
        planners. We do not have a fiduciary relationship with you. We do not know your personal financial
        circumstances, risk tolerance, time horizon, or investment objectives.
      </p>

      <h2>Trading involves risk</h2>
      <p>
        Trading and investing in stocks, options, ETFs, cryptocurrencies, and other financial instruments involves
        substantial risk of loss. You may lose some or all of your principal. Past performance does not indicate or
        guarantee future results. Hypothetical or modeled returns have inherent limitations.
      </p>

      <h2>Do your own research</h2>
      <p>
        Any decision to buy, sell, or hold a security is solely your responsibility. Always conduct your own
        research and consult with a licensed financial professional before making investment decisions.
      </p>

      <h2>Forward-looking statements</h2>
      <p>
        Content on this site may contain forward-looking statements about market conditions, prices, or specific
        companies. These statements are based on current expectations and assumptions and are subject to risks and
        uncertainties. Actual results may differ materially.
      </p>

      <h2>Positions disclosure</h2>
      <p>
        Operators of Leaving The Matrix may hold positions in any security mentioned. Positions can change at any
        time without notice. We attempt to disclose meaningful positions in real time within the Discord but make
        no guarantee of completeness.
      </p>

      <h2>No guarantee of accuracy</h2>
      <p>
        We make no representation or warranty regarding the accuracy, completeness, or timeliness of any content.
        Information may be outdated, incomplete, or simply wrong. Verify everything against primary sources before
        acting.
      </p>

      <h2>Limitation of liability</h2>
      <p>
        Under no circumstances will Leaving The Matrix, its operators, affiliates, or contributors be liable for any
        loss or damage arising from your use of the site, the Discord, or any content provided.
      </p>

      <p class="mt-12 text-sm text-bone-mute">
        <em>This disclaimer is a placeholder draft. Final language pending review by qualified legal counsel before launch.</em>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
